# Connect IQ build output
bin/
*.prg
*.prg.debug.xml
*.iq
gen/
# developer key — never commit
*.der
developer_key*
# tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.DS_Store
.copilot-specs-cache/

# Vendor documentation shared with us by Freelap under confidence. It is not
# ours to redistribute, so it must never be committed - not here, not in docs/,
# and not quoted at length in a public issue. Keep the file outside the repo
# (../freelap-vendor-docs/); this rule is the second line of defence.
*.pdf

# Test fixtures derived from the confidential Freelap frame document. They are
# the only external ground truth we have for the decoder, so the tests that use
# them skip rather than fail when they are absent (see
# tools/tests/test_freelap_frame.py). Not ours to publish - see #8.
# ...and wherever the vendor folder itself lands. The confidential fixture
# has already been found sitting one directory move away from a path-specific
# rule; a name-based rule does not care where it is.
vendor_*.json
freelap-vendor-docs/
